# Code review checklist

Use for PRs, diffs, or explicit review requests.

## Must verify

- [ ] **Correctness:** happy path, edge cases, failure modes.
- [ ] **Security:** parameterized SQL; XSS-safe rendering; log injection mitigated (`Encode.forJava` per `java-spring-backend.mdc`); no secrets in code/logs; safe path handling; CSRF/CORS/BOLA per `security-baseline.mdc` when touching auth, cookies, CORS, or resource IDs.
- [ ] **API/events:** boundary validation; DTOs not entities; idempotent event handling; HTTP semantics per `api-and-events.mdc`.
- [ ] **Observability:** useful logs at state transitions and external calls; trace context (`traceparent` / OTel) propagated; no PII/secrets in logs.
- [ ] **Complexity/coverage:** methods ≤30 lines, cognitive complexity ≤15 per `quality-and-testing.mdc`.
- [ ] **Error handling:** no empty catches; exception paths tested.
- [ ] **Docs/diagrams:** README, architecture, network, sequence docs updated if behavior or topology changed — `architecture-and-diagrams.mdc`.

## Feedback format

- **Critical** — merge blocker
- **Suggestion** — should fix unless justified
- **Nice to have** — optional polish

